       Ensure at least one of each endpoint type appears across all groups.
       Insert 1-2 blank rows between groups; add 1 blank row at top and bottom of inner area.
       Compute H = inner_rows + 2.
    4. Build the output grid; fill frame border + divider, left panel with runs, right panel with expanded runs.
    5. Derive input by erasing right panel active area back to right_bg.
